# Update the persisted spatial calibration. Set a field to NaN to leave it
# unchanged. The new values are persisted to disk and re-published on the
# latched `calibration` topic.
#
# Send um_per_px_width (the frame width) AND um_per_px_window (the sensor window
# width it was seen through) with every um_per_px, or the scale cannot be
# converted when the camera changes sensor mode -- cropping and binning move it
# in different ways. See Calibration.msg for the conversion. 0 = leave unchanged
# (ints have no NaN).
float64 um_per_px
int32 um_per_px_width
int32 um_per_px_window
float64 steps_per_um_x
float64 steps_per_um_y
float64 steps_per_um_z
---
bool success
string message
